1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,647
Agencies charge ₹15,000 to ₹25,000 for one video ad.

2
00:00:05,817 --> 00:00:09,286
Now you can make it yourself, for ₹0.

3
00:00:09,456 --> 00:00:14,150
In this video I'll show you the full setup, and one important catch.

4
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:17,947
And at the end, five prompts you can copy directly.

5
00:00:18,897 --> 00:00:21,480
First, let's see what's new.

6
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:25,314
On 9 November, Claude Fable 5.2 launched.

7
00:00:25,484 --> 00:00:31,902
Along with it, Higgsfield is giving new users a 3-day, that is 72-hour, free trial.

8
00:00:32,072 --> 00:00:38,320
They advertise unlimited access to top video, image and audio models during the trial.

9
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:42,117
It works inside Claude, through the Higgsfield connector.

10
00:00:43,217 --> 00:00:45,436
What can you make with it?

11
00:00:45,606 --> 00:00:48,116
Product ads, cinematic shots,

12
00:00:48,286 --> 00:00:52,871
UGC-style customer review videos, anime, and motion graphics.

13
00:00:53,041 --> 00:00:58,282
Remember, this offer has no published end date. It can end anytime.

14
00:00:59,382 --> 00:01:02,657
Now, three things you need before you start.

15
00:01:02,827 --> 00:01:08,034
One, a paid Claude plan. You need a paid plan to use Fable 5.2.

16
00:01:08,204 --> 00:01:12,841
Two, a Higgsfield account. This trial is for new users only.

17
00:01:13,011 --> 00:01:19,213
Three, a card may be asked to start the trial, so keep a debit or credit card ready.

18
00:01:20,313 --> 00:01:24,913
Okay, now let's set it up step by step. There are six steps in total.

19
00:01:26,263 --> 00:01:29,722
Step one. Open Claude on the web or in the app.

20
00:01:29,892 --> 00:01:34,235
Then go to Customize, and click Connectors inside it.

21
00:01:35,335 --> 00:01:38,527
Step two. Click Add custom connector.

22
00:01:38,697 --> 00:01:41,050
For the name, enter Higgsfield.

23
00:01:41,220 --> 00:01:45,198
For the URL, enter this link exactly as shown on screen.

24
00:01:45,368 --> 00:01:49,459
The link is also in the description. Just copy and paste it.

25
00:01:50,809 --> 00:01:53,771
Step three. Click the Connect button.

26
00:01:53,941 --> 00:01:59,645
The Higgsfield sign-in page opens. Log in there, or create a new account.

27
00:01:59,815 --> 00:02:02,277
When it asks for permission, click Allow.

28
00:02:03,377 --> 00:02:09,409
Step four. Go to higgsfield.ai/mcp and start the free trial.

29
00:02:09,579 --> 00:02:12,029
It may ask for your card details here.

30
00:02:13,129 --> 00:02:16,685
Step five. This is the most important step.

31
00:02:16,855 --> 00:02:21,562
Right after starting the trial, open Subscription or Billing in your Higgsfield account.

32
00:02:21,732 --> 00:02:27,606
Cancel auto-renew there. Even after cancelling, the trial stays active for the 3 days.

33
00:02:28,706 --> 00:02:32,991
Step six. Now come back to Claude and just ask for what you want.

34
00:02:33,161 --> 00:02:37,152
For example: “Make a 10-second vertical ad for my bakery.”

35
00:02:37,322 --> 00:02:42,381
Claude picks the model, writes the prompt, and generates the video.

36
00:02:44,331 --> 00:02:46,732
Now, the most important catch.

37
00:02:46,902 --> 00:02:52,203
After 72 hours, this free trial automatically renews into a paid plan.

38
00:02:52,373 --> 00:02:59,425
Higgsfield's Ultra plan, at 40% off the first month. If you don't cancel, your card gets charged.

39
00:02:59,595 --> 00:03:05,251
So cancel right after you sign up. Don't wait for the 3 days to end.

40
00:03:06,501 --> 00:03:12,108
Here's the path: Higgsfield account, Subscription or Billing, Cancel auto-renew.

41
00:03:12,278 --> 00:03:17,679
Make sure the screen shows it's cancelled. Taking a screenshot is also a good idea.

42
00:03:18,929 --> 00:03:21,063
The second thing: credits.

43
00:03:21,233 --> 00:03:27,287
Higgsfield's own help page says connector generations may still deduct credits.

44
00:03:27,457 --> 00:03:33,416
So first generate just one short video. Then check your credit balance.

45
00:03:33,586 --> 00:03:37,262
Only if credits aren't deducted, go ahead and make more videos.

46
00:03:38,362 --> 00:03:43,799
Now, five prompts you can copy and use directly. One for each style.

47
00:03:44,899 --> 00:03:50,944
One, a product ad. For a shoe shop, festive offer, 50% off, in an upbeat mood.

48
00:03:51,114 --> 00:03:54,231
Just change it to your shop's name and offer.

49
00:03:55,481 --> 00:04:01,925
Two, cinematic. A Kerala morning, golden light, a slow-motion shot of hot tea being poured.

50
00:04:03,575 --> 00:04:10,129
Three, a UGC review. A review of the bakery's plum cake, as if a customer shot it on a phone.

51
00:04:11,779 --> 00:04:17,338
Four, anime. An 8-second anime scene of a shopkeeper opening the shop at sunrise.

52
00:04:18,988 --> 00:04:25,057
Five, motion graphics. A promo for a mobile shop, with bold text and clean transitions.

53
00:04:25,227 --> 00:04:28,137
All five prompts are in the description.

54
00:04:29,487 --> 00:04:32,010
Now, a few tips for good results.

55
00:04:32,180 --> 00:04:36,256
For Reels and Shorts, ask for the 9:16 vertical size.

56
00:04:36,426 --> 00:04:41,766
Keep each clip 5 to 10 seconds. Short clips are also easier to redo.

57
00:04:41,936 --> 00:04:44,932
Download each clip as soon as it's made.

58
00:04:45,102 --> 00:04:48,789
Then join the clips in any editing app.

59
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:52,974
Finally, don't forget to add your logo and phone number.

60
00:04:54,074 --> 00:04:55,893
Let's recap quickly.

61
00:04:56,063 --> 00:05:01,454
Paid Claude plan. Higgsfield connector added. Signed in and allowed.

62
00:05:01,624 --> 00:05:05,690
Free trial started. Auto-renew cancelled right away.

63
00:05:05,860 --> 00:05:10,643
Made one short video and checked credits. With that, you're ready.

64
00:05:12,393 --> 00:05:17,536
Orbynex can make video ads and AI automation for your business.

65
00:05:17,706 --> 00:05:23,639
Website: orbynex.io. Phone: 7012937250.

66
00:05:23,809 --> 00:05:29,125
If you liked the video, subscribe. If you have any doubts, comment below.
